# Salted SHA-256 hashes of names that must never appear in this repository (fnd §7.4, ADR 0004).
# Each line below the header is sha256("<salt>:<name>"), the name lower-cased with everything but
# ASCII letters and digits removed. The names themselves are never committed. Add one with
# scripts/private-name-add.sh; the private-names check (FND-04) hashes every token of changed
# text, and every run of 2 or 3 adjacent tokens joined, and fails on a match.
